      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Many are paralysed by fear. We are ignited by it. In the face of destructive
    action around the world, our leaders have stayed silent, been complacent, and
    refused to take action of their own. Following the cyclical path of the sun,
    all things shall rise and set. To hang in the sky is to scorch the ground. The
    way we entered is the way we must exit. THE BODY IS NOT AN ENGINE. THE HAND IS
    NOT A COG. THE EARTH IS A CREPUSCULAR BEING. BREAK THE MACHINE. BREAK THE MACHINE.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
