      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Many believed the turn of the millenneium would spark change in the world.
    Turn hearts. Change minds. Instead, we have seen renewed dedication to the destruction
    of humanity by humanity. \nWe are a group of individual actors committed to stopping
    destruction. Destruction of the natural world. Destruction of each other. Which,
    at its core, is the destruction of ourselves."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
